document.head.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend", "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/noto-serif-sc@5.3.1/400.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/noto-serif-sc@5.3.1/700.css\">");
document.body.insertAdjacentHTML("afterbegin", "<div id=\"intro\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/intro-cover.webp\" alt=\"\"><div class=\"title\"><span>MIDSOMMAR</span>仲夏夜</div></div>\n<div class=\"seam\"></div>\n<div class=\"main\">\n<div class=\"lead\"><p>毕业季，你陪女友洛槿、还有她的同学祝凛，跟着瑞典闺蜜莉妮娅一起飞往瑞典中部的哈尔辛兰。</p><p>山谷深处的哈尔加村，今年夏至正赶上九十年一次的庆典。这里的极昼太阳不落，村里人都会换上亲手织的白色亚麻衣裙，围着五月柱跳舞。</p><p>只是你还没意识到，这场旅行从一开始就不是单纯的做客——莉妮娅和村里的姑娘们，正盘算着把你永远留在哈尔加。是顺从她们的挽留，还是带着身边的人离开？接下来的每一步怎么走，全由你决定。</p></div>\n<div class=\"pv\"><video controls playsinline preload=\"none\" poster=\"https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/pv-poster.webp\"><source src=\"https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/pv.webm\" type='video/webm; codecs=\"av01.0.08M.10, opus\"'><source src=\"https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/pv.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\n<h2>她们</h2>\n<div class=\"grid g2\">\n<div class=\"cell girl\" style=\"--c:#D8452F\"><div class=\"h\"><i style=\"background-image:url(https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/portrait-luo-jin-lu-shang.webp);background-size:252% auto;background-position:47% 12%\"></i><span class=\"t\">洛槿</span></div>和你交往一年半的女友，人类学大三学生。平时安静敏锐，谁情绪不对她总是第一个察觉；但在熟悉的人面前爱说爱笑，平时很喜欢粘着你闹。</div>\n<div class=\"cell girl\" style=\"--c:#B88A0F\"><div class=\"h\"><i style=\"background-image:url(https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/portrait-li-ni-ya-wai-mian.webp);background-size:245% auto;background-position:56.5% 10.7%\"></i><span class=\"t\">莉妮娅</span></div>洛槿无话不谈的瑞典闺蜜，在哈尔加村长大，也是这次邀请你们来村里做客的人。她说话慢声细气，很会倾听，笑起来眉眼弯弯的，让人很有亲切感。</div>\n<div class=\"cell girl\" style=\"--c:#E48AA3\"><div class=\"h\"><i style=\"background-image:url(https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/portrait-bu-li-ta-ri-chang.webp);background-size:245% auto;background-position:43% 26%\"></i><span class=\"t\">布丽塔</span></div>哈尔加村的姑娘，莉妮娅从小带大的妹妹。性格直爽热情，喜欢谁就会大方表现出来，对村子外面的世界有问不完的问题。</div>\n<div class=\"cell girl\" style=\"--c:#8A6CB4\"><div class=\"h\"><i style=\"background-image:url(https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/portrait-ai-la-wai-mian-v2.webp);background-size:252% auto;background-position:55% 12%\"></i><span class=\"t\">艾拉</span></div>村里的药草师，之前在外面生活过几年，今年夏天特地回村过节。性格安静温柔，说话轻声细语，总能在最恰当的时候出现在你身边。</div>\n<div class=\"cell girl\" style=\"--c:#3F6FB5\"><div class=\"h\"><i style=\"background-image:url(https://testingcf.jsdelivr.net/gh/ssd-tavern/midsommar@main/assets/portrait-zhu-lin-ri-chang.webp);background-size:245% auto;background-position:41% 14.3%\"></i><span class=\"t\">祝凛</span></div>人类学大四学生，毕业论文写的就是瑞典仲夏节。大小姐出身，说话做事很有分寸，是队伍里最靠谱的主心骨；唯独一聊起民俗学就会瞬间两眼放光。</div>\n</div>\n<h2>玩法说明</h2>\n<div class=\"grid g2\">\n<div class=\"cell\" style=\"--c:#B88A0F\"><span class=\"t\">体验剧情</span>跟随十天行程（抵达日 + 村中 9 天）亲历整场仲夏庆典。每天分上午、下午、傍晚、夜晚四个时段，每回合最多推进一个时段，结局由你一路的选择决定。</div>\n<div class=\"cell\" style=\"--c:#D8452F\"><span class=\"t\">场景探索</span>经历机场、旅途与村外草地的序章后，即可在村内 17 处场景间自由移动，全场景均配备独立插画。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"go\"><button id=\"go\">进入开场</button></div>\n<p class=\"credit\">制卡 ssd（类脑 @buyssdcom）<span>保留一切权利</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\nhtml,body{overflow:hidden}\nbody{font-family:\"Noto Serif SC\",\"Source Han Serif SC\",\"Songti SC\",\"STSong\",\"SimSun\",serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#27302A;background:transparent}\n#intro{background:#FBFAF6;border:1px solid #E2DFD3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\n.cover{position:relative;aspect-ratio:3/2}\n.cover img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}\n.cover::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:55% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(20,24,18,.62))}\n.title{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:6%;z-index:1;text-align:center;font-size:40px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.32em;text-indent:.32em;line-height:1.2;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.title span{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.6em;text-indent:.6em;opacity:.85}\n.pv{margin-top:16px;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}\n.pv video{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}\n.seam{height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5E7E44,#E8B923,#D8452F,#E48AA3,#8A6CB4,#3F6FB5)}\n.main{padding:16px 18px 18px}\n.lead{font-size:14px;line-height:1.95;text-align:justify}\n.lead p+p{margin-top:6px}\nh2{margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.14em}\n.grid{display:grid;gap:8px}\n.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n.cell{padding:10px 12px 11px;border:1px solid #E2DFD3;border-radius:8px;background:#FFFFFF;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.75}\n.cell .t{display:block;margin-bottom:3px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--c)}\n.girl .h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.girl .h .t{margin:0}\n.girl i{flex:none;width:64px;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:10px;background-repeat:no-repeat}\n.go{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:18px}\n#go{padding:9px 44px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#5E7E44;font:inherit;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.3em;text-indent:.3em;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s}\n#go:hover{filter:brightness(1.1)}\n.credit{margin-top:14px;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-align:center;color:#6B7166}\n.credit span{margin-left:1.5em}\n@media (max-width:520px){.main{padding:14px 12px 16px}.lead{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9}.title{font-size:30px}.girl i{width:52px}.cell{font-size:12px}}\n</style>");
document.getElementById('go').addEventListener('click', () => triggerSlash('/swipe'));
